  "stageId": "act18d0_05",
  "title": "Reefsteep's Land",
  "storyCode": "WD-5",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/act18d0/level_act18d0_05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "2d70f72864c3d197ae3c744e8a80a2872ff3caf8da305e38b1295cf6a639ca41",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "4上"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Modern Day\n3:32 P.M. \\ Clear\nCentral Sargon, Ibut Region, Nameless Town"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_indoor4"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Heavyrain",
      "speakerId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You want to come with...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Heavyrain",
      "speakerId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You should know that you are just another suspicious character to us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Have you inspected your teammates yet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sesa",
      "speakerId": "char_379_sesa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Heavyrain?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Heavyrain",
      "speakerId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Everything's normal there..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Heavyrain",
      "speakerId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But I don't trust you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yes, very well said. Of course I am not to be trusted."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Heavyrain",
      "speakerId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What exactly is your objective?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "My objective... is to find out what my objective actually is."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Heavyrain",
      "speakerId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What the actual—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Did you know that the last Lord Ameer of Ibut died in a fire?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sesa",
      "speakerId": "char_379_sesa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That was a few years ago... The current Lord Ameer is his son, and that whole thing caused quite a ruckus in Ibut."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sesa",
      "speakerId": "char_379_sesa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I had to find myself a new fairy godmother right away thanks to that fire. Took me months to get used to the work there. Huge pain in the butt."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Right, exactly. He was my very last prey."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I did all the preparations and laid out my trap, but there's no more prey to hunt. I have nothing to do except to lounge around."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sesa",
      "speakerId": "char_379_sesa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Heavyrain",
      "speakerId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "—Y-You killed a Lord Ameer?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sesa",
      "speakerId": "char_379_sesa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The Sargon army will find you—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sesa",
      "speakerId": "char_379_sesa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "—Wait, hold on, what do you even want, telling us about this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ah, I shouldn't have expected any less from one who frequents the black markets. That's right, there is no one who knows I have to do with his death aside from you and me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "As for the Sargon army... We live in different times now. The ruling Padishahs simply care not about what is happening here in this barren wasteland."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "My guess is that it matters not to them whether it's the father or the son that's in charge. Actually, to tell the truth, it hardly matters to me either."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I sought his death and nothing else. It was a rather simple request."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Heavyrain",
      "speakerId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What are you after anyway?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Revenge."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm afraid it's a rather boring answer, so I don't like to share it. If I have to venture a guess, more than half of the men in this world would like to take revenge against something, be it their enemies, a city, or even the world itself."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "For the past twenty years, that is all I have been doing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "My power, my status, my riches... All of them come second, and should the need arise, I will cast them all aside."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Or perhaps I could give them to this 'Rhodes Island.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's quite the bargain, wouldn't you agree?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Heavyrain",
      "speakerId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hoh, looks like you are still not convinced, young lady. You are quite cautious. I suppose you were a soldier? From Sargon, perhaps?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Heavyrain",
      "speakerId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "—None of your business."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What about you, young 'Bridge?' Or should I call you by the name you go by now, 'Sesa?'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sesa",
      "speakerId": "char_379_sesa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Heavyrain",
      "speakerId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sesa, we can't trust him."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sesa",
      "speakerId": "char_379_sesa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're hiding something pretty important, aren't you now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hmm?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh... Yes. Right, how forgetful of me..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You claim to be a medical corporation that treats the Infected... Very well, it's a fairly tall tale, but I will accept it for the moment."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I am an Infected."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "My fortunes are no less impressive than the Lord Ameers' riches, and I am well-connected and hold some sway, enough for me to bring a Lord Ameer to his downfall."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I will trade all of it for a chance to be cured. What do you say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Heavyrain",
      "speakerId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "—You're mad."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I find myself thinking the same quite often."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But there is not a single person who walks these lands and wishes not to live. Is it not reasonable of me to want to cast all this aside just for a chance to be cured?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sesa",
      "speakerId": "char_379_sesa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Nah, I don't think that's what Heavyrain's trying to say."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sesa",
      "speakerId": "char_379_sesa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You don't even seem to care that you're Infected..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sesa",
      "speakerId": "char_379_sesa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What is it that you want at Rhodes Island?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Very well. There isn't much time left, so let us stop beating around the bush."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm looking for 'Kal'tsit.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Perhaps she will impart on me some invaluable advice, perhaps she will show me a new way forward... Yet it's even more likely that she won't lift a finger, merely passing the decision back to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That too is fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Once I eliminate every last person involved in that incident years ago, there will be nothing more tying me to this place. I am beyond anxious to leave this forsaken land behind."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I need a fresh start."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And who could blame me for seizing the opportunity if the shadows of the past so happen to be standing right there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Heavyrain",
      "speakerId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What's your relationship with Dr. Kal'tsit?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hmm... It's a long story."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I owe her my life. I'm very thankful to her. This I say from the bottom of my heart."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Heavyrain",
      "speakerId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The decision isn't ours to make..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sesa",
      "speakerId": "char_379_sesa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Three years ago... the Lord Ameer of Ibut perished in a fire during his travels. The fire consumed an entire town, and, soon after, his son set off a rebellion, vying for the throne against his many other contenders."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sesa",
      "speakerId": "char_379_sesa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That's your doing, eh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Precisely, just as I said."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sesa",
      "speakerId": "char_379_sesa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Why?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "All trivial matters of a bygone era. The family had a tragic, rocky relationship to start. I only played a very minor role."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Why do you want to know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sesa",
      "speakerId": "char_379_sesa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm looking for clues... Thanks to you, I gotta call it quits with my investigation in the Ibut region."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ah... clues."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Perhaps this is an opportunity for me to earn your trust. Tell me what it is you are looking for. Perhaps I will be of assistance."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sesa",
      "speakerId": "char_379_sesa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm looking for someone. The director of a Columbian military experiment."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You are investigating a Columbian company. May I ask why?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sesa",
      "speakerId": "char_379_sesa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Because the person I respected the most died in the most laughable accident ever..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And what if it was actually an accident?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sesa",
      "speakerId": "char_379_sesa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Even if it was just an accident... I gotta know the truth. I mean, this couldn't have been the reason those guys rose through the ranks on top of my brother's death."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Heavyrain",
      "speakerId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sesa..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sesa",
      "speakerId": "char_379_sesa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I know. It's my own personal issue... but this chance doesn't come often. Don't you agree, 'Sand Soldier'?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Heh... Ahem, pardon me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Where was I?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Everyone needs a revenge of some kind. Targets can be big or small, and grudges can run deep or shallow, but revenge is an eternal motif to every living person out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If you permit me to undergo treatment at Rhodes Island, I can investigate this matter for you. Of course, the deals we talked about still stand."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Even if you have ten times the cargo sitting outside, I have a way to take care of it all. There will be no trace left of it, and you will find the price very attractive. It's a bargain for a pharmaceutical company."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Heavyrain",
      "speakerId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sesa... Sorry, but we can't let your personal problems be somebody else's bargaining chip."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sesa",
      "speakerId": "char_379_sesa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Of course I know that... but I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Right... I almost forgot. It seems I've been rather forgetful of late."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I never thought much of Old Isin's prophecy to begin with. However, thinking back, perhaps the prophecy was itself a means of negotiation and communication."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hmph, prophecy... Mere mortals will never find themselves on equal footing with time itself. Originium Arts may have many convenient uses, but that is one thing you can never achieve with Arts."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sesa",
      "speakerId": "char_379_sesa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "A prophecy...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Alas, Old Isin passed away long ago. I only hope that she remembers this promise."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Did she perhaps... give you a gold coin?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "An old Sargon gold coin."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Heavyrain",
      "speakerId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Heavyrain, Sesa, we got a situation here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sesa",
      "speakerId": "char_379_sesa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Calm down. What's up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "There are some sketchy-looking teams approaching the town."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let me remind you that they are not friendly."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ugh, they're closing in quick. We can still get out of here without a fight if we make a run for it now. Take our time and we won't be so lucky."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Fifteen minutes. That's all we have. Captain, Lieutenant, hurry."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Heavyrain",
      "speakerId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "—Your buddies?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Of course not. I am a lone wolf with no one to turn to. Unlike machines, humans cannot be trusted."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That being said, they are most likely here for me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sesa",
      "speakerId": "char_379_sesa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "—Dammit! This is part of your plan, isn't it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You can help me escape, or we can fend off these unyielding assassins together."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What do you say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Heavyrain",
      "speakerId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "W-What should we do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The ball is in your court."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sesa",
      "speakerId": "char_379_sesa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Tch, son of a—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sesa",
      "speakerId": "char_379_sesa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "—Last question, then! Why did you burn down that town? If you were after the Lord Ameer, you had no reason to drag all those people into that mess."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sesa",
      "speakerId": "char_379_sesa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You even gave the townspeople the time to evacuate. Did you just want to ruin the town? Redhorn was miles away from your turf. What were you after exactly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Is my objective really so important?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sesa",
      "speakerId": "char_379_sesa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "—I'm making sure you're not a warmonger, or downright nuts."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hmm, you have a point, but I am afraid you wouldn't understand. All I burned down was my past."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sesa",
      "speakerId": "char_379_sesa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Is that your revenge?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Sand Soldier'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_172_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It was a long overdue cremation, nothing more."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
